[by:暗尘_]
[00:00.00]作词 : Sandro Cavazza/Georgia Ku/Victor Thell/Jonas Jurström/Robin Stjernberg/Johan Lindbrandt
[00:00.25]作曲 : Sandro Cavazza/Georgia Ku/Victor Thell/Jonas Jurström/Robin Stjernberg/Johan Lindbrandt
[00:00.51]Some days I really wanna hate you 有些日子 我真的很想恨你
[00:05.24]'Cause you always know just what to say 因为你总是知道什么能说出口
[00:09.97]By now I know the words to break you 但如今，我知晓了能击碎你的话语
[00:15.07]And you know what breaks me too 你也知道什么样的话语能击碎我
[00:19.15]When things get heated 事情千钧一发
[00:21.99]We say things we don't mean then 我们口是心非
[00:24.13]Though we know they ain't true 尽管我们知道这并非事实
[00:29.05]Say you're leaving 你说你要离我而去
[00:31.55]Get careless with our feelings 对我们的感受置之不理
[00:33.97]What's the worst we can do? 我们能破头烂额到什么地步呢
[00:38.38]I didn't tell you all my secrets just to pull my heart out 我告诉你我的所有 不是为了你的交浅言深
[00:43.11]I didn't take you to my family just to show you the house 我把你带回家中远不是为了给你展示房子
[00:48.14]I didn't work this hard to get this far then leave it so soon 我费尽千辛万苦走到这一步并不是为了转身离开
[00:53.14]I didn't love to lose somebody like you 我不想失去你这样的人
[00:56.20](Love to lose somebody like you)
[00:59.18]Some nights we're closer than ever 有些夜晚 我们亲密无间
[01:04.05]Sometimes we're running out of space 有些时候 我们已无退路
[01:08.94]When we're high it can't get any better 我们心潮澎湃之时 那就再好不过
[01:13.80]Until we come down again 直到我们又一次坠入低谷
